WEBVTT

00:00:01.140 --> 00:00:02.480
Chara-su!

00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:04.810
Is everyone shugo-peppy again today?

00:00:04.810 --> 00:00:07.830
It's time to start Shugo Chara Party!

00:00:07.830 --> 00:00:10.300
The next thirty minutes is chock full of shugo-cute anime!

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:11.790
Let's enjoy it together!

00:00:11.790 --> 00:00:13.180
Everyone's hearts:

00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:14.860
Unlock!

00:00:14.950 --> 00:00:17.200
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:20.710
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:24.510
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:24.510 --> 00:00:26.380
You may be so sweet girl

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:28.230
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:28.230 --> 00:00:30.110
you're like a dream.

00:00:30.110 --> 00:00:31.960
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:31.960 --> 00:00:33.850
You may be so sweet girl

00:00:33.850 --> 00:00:35.690
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:35.690 --> 00:00:37.490
it's like I'm dreaming.

00:00:37.490 --> 00:00:41.290
Whenever I start something new

00:00:41.290 --> 00:00:45.000
I get really excited,

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:48.670
though I pretend like it's nothing at all.

00:00:48.670 --> 00:00:51.810
I've always been stubborn like that.

00:00:51.810 --> 00:00:59.450
I think it'd be nice if I could just be honest with myself.

00:00:59.450 --> 00:01:03.240
But it's hard, you know?

00:01:03.240 --> 00:01:07.370
I'll try working on it bit by bit.

00:01:07.980 --> 00:01:11.990
It's party time!

00:01:11.990 --> 00:01:15.740
Someday I'll transform into someone brand new.

00:01:15.740 --> 00:01:19.480
But for now, I want to forget everything else

00:01:19.480 --> 00:01:23.680
and discover all of the potential in me.

00:01:23.680 --> 00:01:26.890
It's party time!

00:01:26.890 --> 00:01:30.600
That brand new me is out there somewhere.

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:34.110
But for now, I just want to stay as I am

00:01:34.110 --> 00:01:38.740
and find all of the things I can be.

00:01:38.740 --> 00:01:40.530
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:01:48.400 --> 00:01:51.040
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:01:51.040 --> 00:01:53.710
"Kusukusu Can't Laugh!"

00:02:00.050 --> 00:02:02.500
Ready yet?

00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:04.060
Ready!

00:02:04.360 --> 00:02:06.820
Okay! Ready or not, here I come!

00:02:08.200 --> 00:02:12.490
Oh, Kusukusu! What are you doing there?

00:02:15.500 --> 00:02:17.690
Something's not right here.

00:02:19.250 --> 00:02:20.920
What is the matter?

00:02:20.920 --> 00:02:23.620
Kusukusu's acting funny.

00:02:24.970 --> 00:02:27.380
True, she's usually...

00:02:28.530 --> 00:02:30.390
Giggling like crazy.

00:02:30.390 --> 00:02:32.870
She must be feeling glum.

00:02:32.870 --> 00:02:33.460
I'll fix that!

00:02:33.460 --> 00:02:36.310
Bala-balance!

00:02:37.830 --> 00:02:39.930
Kusukusu can't laugh?!

00:02:39.930 --> 00:02:41.860
This is a cataclysm of epic proportions!

00:02:41.860 --> 00:02:45.400
All right! Then we have no choice but to <i>make</i> her laugh!

00:02:45.400 --> 00:02:47.150
Yeah!

00:02:47.150 --> 00:02:49.080
I'll go first.

00:02:49.820 --> 00:02:52.090
What might this be?!

00:02:53.280 --> 00:02:55.350
It was a banana peel, it was!

00:02:55.950 --> 00:02:57.300
No dice?

00:02:57.300 --> 00:02:58.900
All right, let me try.

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:03.180
It is complete!

00:03:04.250 --> 00:03:05.390
Nope...

00:03:05.390 --> 00:03:08.660
Just leave this to Su!

00:03:09.440 --> 00:03:11.420
Here is Su's special dish!

00:03:11.420 --> 00:03:18.240
I call it "The Lunch That'll Make Anyone Roll Around in a Fit of Laughter Plate!"

00:03:24.640 --> 00:03:26.600
I failed!

00:03:26.600 --> 00:03:29.800
How are we ever going to make you laugh?!

00:03:29.800 --> 00:03:31.460
Hey, guys!

00:03:32.850 --> 00:03:35.800
Honestly, take hide and seek seriously, will you?

00:03:35.800 --> 00:03:36.880
Dia!

00:03:36.880 --> 00:03:39.620
Were you still hiding?

00:03:40.070 --> 00:03:41.400
They stopped!

00:03:41.690 --> 00:03:44.760
That surprise made my hiccups go away!

00:03:45.500 --> 00:03:50.460
So that "kusu-kusu" was the hiccups?

00:03:50.460 --> 00:03:51.820
Oh...

00:03:51.820 --> 00:03:56.840
Yeah, and I couldn't laugh because of them, even though you guys were hilarious!

00:03:58.730 --> 00:04:00.360
Kusukusu's laughing.

00:04:00.360 --> 00:04:02.460
All's right with the world.

00:04:02.910 --> 00:04:04.470
No, something's still not right.

00:04:05.880 --> 00:04:08.240
Now I can't stop!

00:04:11.520 --> 00:04:13.890
See you again!

00:04:14.900 --> 00:04:16.900
Shugo Chara Encyclopedia!

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:21.940
The first character we'll introduce is... Il!

00:04:24.240 --> 00:04:28.620
Il, sporting that stylin' devil outfit, is the idol Utau's Guardian Character.

00:04:28.620 --> 00:04:33.500
She loves to tease and play pranks, but <i>hates</i> being preached at.

00:04:33.500 --> 00:04:38.110
She's sort of a problem character, but she's nice sometimes, too.

00:04:38.110 --> 00:04:41.840
Once in a while. Occasionally. Yeah...

00:04:48.080 --> 00:04:54.390
The second character we'll introduce is... El!

00:04:55.940 --> 00:05:00.990
Playful El in her angel outfit is Utau's other Guardian Character.

00:05:00.990 --> 00:05:02.940
She's kind, and does everything her own way.

00:05:03.210 --> 00:05:08.370
She hates bad things, and has a slight tendency to get preachy.

00:05:08.370 --> 00:05:12.040
She gets teased by Il and cries a lot.

00:05:17.100 --> 00:05:20.240
We'll keep doing these Shugo Chara Encyclopedia introductions each week!

00:05:20.240 --> 00:05:21.790
Look forward to it!

00:05:24.610 --> 00:05:27.760
Shugo, shugo! Egg Battle!

00:05:27.760 --> 00:05:31.100
Today we'll play the "Chopsticks Master!" quiz game!

00:05:31.100 --> 00:05:35.060
Once you've solved the quiz, use your chopsticks to transfer the eggs!

00:05:35.060 --> 00:05:38.350
When you're done with that, you can answer the question!

00:05:38.350 --> 00:05:39.850
Okay, here's the question:

00:05:39.850 --> 00:05:43.330
What is Amu's role in the Guardians?

00:05:43.330 --> 00:05:44.920
I know!

00:05:44.920 --> 00:05:47.810
Since everyone knows the answer, start chopstickin'!

00:05:47.810 --> 00:05:50.650
But it's not going to be so easy!

00:05:53.900 --> 00:05:57.160
Spade's on the third one, taking a huge lead!

00:05:57.160 --> 00:06:03.010
Clover sucks at this game most of all, but at least she's on egg two.

00:06:03.010 --> 00:06:04.610
Spade is... fast!

00:06:04.610 --> 00:06:05.990
Okay, what's the answer?

00:06:08.060 --> 00:06:09.800
What was the question again?

00:06:11.890 --> 00:06:14.560
Better start from scratch!

00:06:14.560 --> 00:06:17.230
With Spade not remembering the question, the game's been turned around!

00:06:17.230 --> 00:06:19.690
But Heart and Clover have ground to make up!

00:06:19.890 --> 00:06:22.600
Okay, only one egg left to transfer!

00:06:22.600 --> 00:06:25.310
Who will get it?

00:06:25.310 --> 00:06:28.710
Heart finished first! So, the answer please?

00:06:28.710 --> 00:06:30.150
The Joker!

00:06:30.150 --> 00:06:34.900
Correct! Amu is the Guardians' Joker!

00:06:34.900 --> 00:06:39.340
Today's winner is Amulet Heart! Do your best next time!

00:06:44.110 --> 00:06:46.880
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:06:46.880 --> 00:06:50.070
Shugo Bomber - Part 3."

00:06:53.030 --> 00:06:56.620
Egg Rangers - Shugo Bomber!

00:06:56.620 --> 00:07:01.230
Shugo Killer of Darkness! 0.1 Second Secret Kill Attack!

00:07:04.680 --> 00:07:07.740
Shugo Killer Yoru! I'll bust you up-nya!

00:07:09.010 --> 00:07:10.350
Um...

00:07:10.350 --> 00:07:11.760
What are you doing?

00:07:11.760 --> 00:07:13.740
I'll bust you up-nya!

00:07:16.350 --> 00:07:17.800
Bombger!

00:07:17.800 --> 00:07:19.640
Bombger!

00:07:19.640 --> 00:07:21.140
What now?

00:07:21.140 --> 00:07:23.420
Shugo Killer Yoru is a warrior of darkness!

00:07:23.420 --> 00:07:25.610
Shugo Bomber's rival!

00:07:25.610 --> 00:07:28.480
Because heroes need rivals!

00:07:28.480 --> 00:07:32.590
You have more motivation when you have rivals in sports and studying as well.

00:07:32.590 --> 00:07:34.800
I think this is different.

00:07:34.800 --> 00:07:37.130
Thanks for your help!

00:07:37.130 --> 00:07:39.090
Yes! Snacks!

00:07:39.090 --> 00:07:43.590
Allow me to explain! Shugo Killer Yoru was Ran's best friend!

00:07:43.590 --> 00:07:47.860
But after being bathed in a sinister light, he became a warrior of evil!

00:07:47.860 --> 00:07:49.120
Best friend?

00:07:49.120 --> 00:07:50.950
Aww, the story even has sad parts.

00:07:50.950 --> 00:07:54.860
That's right! Rival characters must have tragic pasts!

00:07:54.860 --> 00:07:56.990
But you just made that all up, Su...

00:07:56.990 --> 00:08:00.060
I see no Su here! Only The Commissioner!

00:08:02.440 --> 00:08:04.050
Look at the mess he's making!

00:08:04.050 --> 00:08:06.300
Go to it, Shugo Fire!

00:08:06.300 --> 00:08:07.850
Why me?

00:08:07.850 --> 00:08:10.390
Because he was your best friend, obviously.

00:08:10.390 --> 00:08:14.010
It's your burdensome destiny to be forced to fight your best friend!

00:08:14.010 --> 00:08:18.520
Can you overcome your heartache, Ran? Bombger!

00:08:18.520 --> 00:08:21.250
I think she wants you to say "bombger."

00:08:22.030 --> 00:08:23.270
Bombger...

00:08:26.330 --> 00:08:27.790
You want some?

00:08:27.790 --> 00:08:30.160
What, can I? All right!

00:08:30.750 --> 00:08:34.310
What is this? Their friendship has been rekindled!

00:08:34.310 --> 00:08:36.560
Ran's feelings got through to him!

00:08:36.560 --> 00:08:37.750
Right...

00:08:37.750 --> 00:08:40.720
I'm so happy for you guys!

00:08:40.720 --> 00:08:42.200
And so...

00:08:44.550 --> 00:08:48.160
The warrior of iron, Shugo Iron, is now on the scene!

00:08:48.160 --> 00:08:48.710
Nya!

00:08:50.240 --> 00:08:54.450
A rival seeing the path of justice and becoming an ally is a standard pattern.

00:08:54.450 --> 00:08:56.180
That's some fast plot development!

00:08:56.180 --> 00:08:58.970
And so, with the birth of this new ally...

00:08:58.970 --> 00:09:02.200
Go! Fight, Shugo Bomber!

00:09:02.660 --> 00:09:05.750
I'll do anything for snacks-nya!

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:09.130
This is never going to end, is it?

00:09:10.150 --> 00:09:14.360
Coming up next is Shugo Chara!!! Dokki Doki!

00:09:14.640 --> 00:09:17.610
Today's episode is titled "Welcome Back, Nadeshiko!"

00:09:17.610 --> 00:09:19.740
Huh? You mean Nadeshiko is...

00:09:19.740 --> 00:09:21.510
...coming back?!

00:09:21.510 --> 00:09:26.550
Is this for real?!

00:09:39.270 --> 00:09:42.850
What's really important?

00:09:44.110 --> 00:09:48.900
Well, it's white and round and sunny,

00:09:48.900 --> 00:09:56.160
and even if they don't know it, everyone has one in their heart.

00:09:57.440 --> 00:10:07.500
The faith I have in others is what keeps me going.

00:10:07.500 --> 00:10:12.220
Guardian Eggs and X Eggs, Guardian Characters and X Characters...

00:10:12.220 --> 00:10:16.590
They're all precious things.

00:10:16.590 --> 00:10:20.760
And so, Open Heart, go!

00:10:20.760 --> 00:10:22.290
Everything'll be okay.

00:10:22.290 --> 00:10:25.350
Because even if you feel lost,

00:10:25.350 --> 00:10:28.780
you're not alone.

00:10:28.780 --> 00:10:30.940
We'll always be together.

00:10:30.940 --> 00:10:33.580
And when I think of that, somehow,

00:10:33.580 --> 00:10:36.610
I feel warm and fuzzy inside.

00:10:36.610 --> 00:10:39.790
Open Heart, now!

00:10:39.790 --> 00:10:41.450
You can see the eggs, right?

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:46.460
They're smiling and bouncing around.

00:10:46.460 --> 00:10:52.300
So from now on, forever and ever...

00:10:52.300 --> 00:10:54.520
I'll be counting on you!

00:11:03.110 --> 00:11:06.460
Wh-Wh-What is this?!

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:12.250
What is this?

00:11:12.250 --> 00:11:14.110
Amu-chan! Rima-chan!

00:11:14.350 --> 00:11:15.150
Yo!

00:11:15.150 --> 00:11:17.120
Good morning. What are you looking at?

00:11:17.120 --> 00:11:20.610
Nagihiko, what's the meaning of this?

00:11:21.920 --> 00:11:27.330
The Fujisaki House Dancing Recital? Fujisaki Nadeshiko to perform?

00:11:28.400 --> 00:11:33.410
Sh-Shoot! They already put up the posters!

00:11:33.410 --> 00:11:35.510
Nadeshiko came back to Japan?

00:11:35.510 --> 00:11:37.210
Why didn't you tell me?

00:11:37.490 --> 00:11:39.260
Uh, well...

00:11:39.570 --> 00:11:42.840
And why hasn't Nadeshiko contacted me?

00:11:42.840 --> 00:11:45.490
Yes... Why indeed...

00:11:48.020 --> 00:11:51.190
I want to see Nadeshiko! Please, Nagihiko?

00:11:53.700 --> 00:11:56.540
This is a seriously bad development!

00:11:58.620 --> 00:12:02.060
Welcome Back, Nadeshiko!

00:12:04.450 --> 00:12:05.800
It's pretty.

00:12:05.800 --> 00:12:07.770
What a lovely stage!

00:12:07.770 --> 00:12:09.710
It's very artistic.

00:12:11.700 --> 00:12:14.050
So, where's Nadeshiko?

00:12:14.050 --> 00:12:16.630
What an <i>excellent</i> question.

00:12:17.920 --> 00:12:20.380
I'll go get her!

00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:40.590
Temari, switch off!

00:12:40.590 --> 00:12:41.400
Of course!

00:12:46.150 --> 00:12:47.670
Amu-chan!

00:12:55.550 --> 00:12:56.830
Long time no see.

00:13:01.290 --> 00:13:03.710
Nadeshiko!

00:13:03.710 --> 00:13:06.140
I've been dying to see you!

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:10.290
Why didn't you ever contact me?

00:13:10.290 --> 00:13:13.550
I'm sorry. I was incredibly busy with my studies.

00:13:13.550 --> 00:13:14.790
Temari!

00:13:14.790 --> 00:13:16.670
Nice to see you again!

00:13:16.670 --> 00:13:18.560
Greetings once again to you all, as well.

00:13:18.800 --> 00:13:21.190
Temari! Long time no see!

00:13:21.190 --> 00:13:25.820
Huh? Isn't this the first time you and Temari have met?

00:13:34.640 --> 00:13:36.090
Oops!

00:13:36.090 --> 00:13:37.790
Please to make your acquaintance.

00:13:38.140 --> 00:13:41.150
Oh, the pleasure is all mine!

00:13:41.150 --> 00:13:46.560
Let me introduce you two. This is Mashiro Rima-san, who took over the Queen's Chair after you.

00:13:46.990 --> 00:13:51.360
Rima, this is my best friend, Fujisaki Nadeshiko.

00:13:52.040 --> 00:13:55.210
N-Nice to meet you, M-Mashiro-san...

00:13:56.970 --> 00:14:01.350
Nice to meet you! You and Nagihiko really do look so much alike!

00:14:01.350 --> 00:14:03.820
It's almost like this isn't the first time we've met!

00:14:07.100 --> 00:14:08.980
Yeah, isn't it something...

00:14:08.980 --> 00:14:13.120
Totally. But you haven't changed one bit.

00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:15.500
Neither have you.

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:16.670
You think so?

00:14:16.670 --> 00:14:18.210
Exquisite!

00:14:18.970 --> 00:14:20.690
Hey, these are artificial flowers!

00:14:20.690 --> 00:14:22.720
Ooh, flowers!

00:14:22.720 --> 00:14:24.960
Oops, it came off.

00:14:26.070 --> 00:14:31.060
Character Change: Chin! Ton! Shan!

00:14:32.010 --> 00:14:34.100
What the heck?!

00:14:34.450 --> 00:14:36.510
Get back here, runt!

00:14:36.510 --> 00:14:39.510
You think you can mess up my stage?!

00:14:39.510 --> 00:14:40.970
Yup, she hasn't changed.

00:14:40.970 --> 00:14:43.190
Hey, where's Nagihiko?

00:14:43.190 --> 00:14:45.730
Now that you mention it, he hasn't come back.

00:14:46.570 --> 00:14:48.620
Hang on!

00:14:51.820 --> 00:14:52.870
Hey, I'm back.

00:14:53.630 --> 00:14:55.040
He's fast...

00:14:55.670 --> 00:14:58.250
Thankfully, I'm an ace at quick wardrobe changes!

00:14:58.560 --> 00:15:01.490
Huh? Now Nadeshiko's gone...

00:15:01.490 --> 00:15:04.790
Nadeshiko! Paging Nadeshiko!

00:15:06.300 --> 00:15:07.960
I'm right here, Amu-chan!

00:15:07.960 --> 00:15:09.790
But where's Nagihiko?

00:15:09.790 --> 00:15:11.680
Need something, Rima-chan?

00:15:11.680 --> 00:15:13.090
Nadeshiko.

00:15:13.090 --> 00:15:15.500
It's so nice to finally be back in Japan!

00:15:15.500 --> 00:15:16.790
Nagihiko.

00:15:18.300 --> 00:15:19.990
Nadeshiko.

00:15:19.990 --> 00:15:23.140
Not Nagihiko, I want Nadeshiko.

00:15:23.140 --> 00:15:24.730
Are you okay? What's the matter?

00:15:26.200 --> 00:15:30.220
I think I'm tired from practice...

00:15:30.220 --> 00:15:32.980
Maybe we should take a walk.

00:15:32.980 --> 00:15:34.200
Okay.

00:15:35.550 --> 00:15:37.950
So, where's Nagihiko?

00:15:38.920 --> 00:15:41.390
He said he had something scheduled.

00:15:47.240 --> 00:15:49.530
How long are you going to be in Japan?

00:15:49.530 --> 00:15:51.750
Until this performance is over.

00:15:51.750 --> 00:15:54.410
I see. That's too bad.

00:15:54.410 --> 00:15:58.100
Since you left, we've had all kinds of problems.

00:15:58.360 --> 00:16:00.410
The ? Eggs appeared!

00:16:00.410 --> 00:16:02.090
We fought Easter!

00:16:02.090 --> 00:16:04.250
I worked real hard!

00:16:04.250 --> 00:16:06.460
Well done, everyone.

00:16:06.910 --> 00:16:11.170
But I knew you'd be okay, Amu-chan.

00:16:11.170 --> 00:16:13.030
I've always believed that.

00:16:13.710 --> 00:16:15.350
Always?

00:16:15.350 --> 00:16:19.830
Even though we're apart, I'm always thinking of you.

00:16:20.100 --> 00:16:22.530
Really? Thank you!

00:16:22.530 --> 00:16:25.920
So, has your dancing improved?

00:16:27.140 --> 00:16:28.410
Yes.

00:16:30.100 --> 00:16:32.200
My soccer ball!

00:16:32.200 --> 00:16:34.110
What's going on?

00:16:34.110 --> 00:16:36.230
Let's get out of here!

00:16:39.430 --> 00:16:40.440
Ran!

00:16:40.440 --> 00:16:41.400
Roger!

00:16:41.400 --> 00:16:42.160
Kusukusu!

00:16:42.160 --> 00:16:43.670
Okay!

00:16:43.670 --> 00:16:45.320
Stand back, Rima-chan.

00:16:46.300 --> 00:16:47.910
I owe you one.

00:16:49.720 --> 00:16:52.650
My heart:

00:16:52.960 --> 00:16:54.410
Unlock!

00:17:08.490 --> 00:17:11.420
Character Transformation: Yamato Maihime!

00:17:13.200 --> 00:17:15.760
Character Transformation: Amulet Heart!

00:17:17.970 --> 00:17:19.890
You Character Transformed!

00:17:19.890 --> 00:17:22.760
Nadeshiko, you can Character Transform?

00:17:23.850 --> 00:17:26.150
It's coming this way, Amu-chan.

00:17:27.480 --> 00:17:29.570
Heart Speeders!

00:17:32.990 --> 00:17:35.520
Wow, it's so fast!

00:17:37.560 --> 00:17:38.320
Watch out!

00:17:47.520 --> 00:17:48.810
Wow...

00:17:49.400 --> 00:17:50.500
She's stunning.

00:17:54.150 --> 00:17:55.300
Robe of Feathers!

00:17:57.840 --> 00:17:59.010
Dance of the Cherry Blossoms!

00:18:05.180 --> 00:18:06.730
Now, Amu-chan!

00:18:08.360 --> 00:18:10.940
Negative Heart: Lock On!

00:18:12.650 --> 00:18:15.530
Open Heart!

00:18:32.200 --> 00:18:37.380
During my studies abroad, I was plagued with a question.

00:18:38.750 --> 00:18:42.770
Would I ever find the true dance of my heart?

00:18:42.770 --> 00:18:44.500
I see...

00:18:44.500 --> 00:18:47.470
But I've overcome that worry now.

00:18:48.490 --> 00:18:51.790
I think I finally know who I really am.

00:18:52.220 --> 00:18:54.940
You had a hand in that, Amu-chan.

00:18:56.220 --> 00:18:57.500
I did?

00:18:58.520 --> 00:19:02.640
I mean, thinking about everyone back here gave me courage.

00:19:02.640 --> 00:19:05.490
I see! Well, that makes me very happy!

00:19:05.490 --> 00:19:09.780
Oh, before I forget. Make sure to come watch me dance!

00:19:10.440 --> 00:19:12.140
Of course! Wouldn't miss it!

00:19:34.780 --> 00:19:38.400
I guess Nadeshiko's probably on a plane by now.

00:19:38.400 --> 00:19:40.360
She sends her greetings to you.

00:19:40.360 --> 00:19:42.250
She sure is busy...

00:19:42.250 --> 00:19:44.620
Next time she comes back, you better tell me, got it?

00:19:44.950 --> 00:19:46.030
Got it.

00:19:47.000 --> 00:19:49.300
Class! Gotta run!

00:19:55.780 --> 00:19:59.660
Thanks for keeping quiet about this, Rima-chan.

00:19:59.660 --> 00:20:02.400
I just didn't want to shock Amu.

00:20:02.400 --> 00:20:04.810
Will you ever tell her?

00:20:04.810 --> 00:20:06.930
I'm not sure whether I should.

00:20:06.930 --> 00:20:12.790
And somehow, I think Amu-chan still needs Nadeshiko.

00:20:12.790 --> 00:20:14.940
Or so you say.

00:20:15.160 --> 00:20:21.460
But the truth is that you just enjoy cross-dressing, don't you?

00:20:21.460 --> 00:20:23.020
Burned!

00:20:23.020 --> 00:20:27.830
I'll keep your secret, but you might have to do me a few favors in return.

00:20:28.700 --> 00:20:30.270
Like what?

00:20:30.270 --> 00:20:35.350
Say, treating me to a parfait on our way home from school today?

00:20:36.960 --> 00:20:40.920
No problem, right, Na-gi-hi-ko?

00:20:45.050 --> 00:20:46.690
Oh my...

00:20:52.450 --> 00:20:55.440
This is a seriously <i>bad</i> turn of events!

00:20:58.890 --> 00:21:01.190
It's time for Guardian Egg Fortune-Telling!

00:21:01.190 --> 00:21:04.450
Choose one of the four eggs!

00:21:06.580 --> 00:21:09.370
Which egg is the lucky one?

00:21:12.960 --> 00:21:15.340
Guardian Egg Friendship Fortune!

00:21:15.340 --> 00:21:17.710
First, for those who chose Su:

00:21:17.710 --> 00:21:18.690
Four Shugoluck Stars!

00:21:18.690 --> 00:21:20.000
Super Lucky!

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:21.800
Your popularity might skyrocket!

00:21:21.800 --> 00:21:24.510
If any of your friends are in trouble, help them out!

00:21:26.150 --> 00:21:28.200
Dia's egg gets three Shugoluck Stars!

00:21:28.200 --> 00:21:30.900
You might have an argument, but there'll be a chance for you to make up!

00:21:28.200 --> 00:21:30.900
Everything will go smoothly this week!

00:21:30.900 --> 00:21:32.670
Ran's egg gets two Shugoluck Stars!

00:21:32.670 --> 00:21:35.610
You'll get some excellent advice from your friends!

00:21:32.670 --> 00:21:35.610
You might learn something new about yourself!

00:21:35.980 --> 00:21:38.700
Finally, for those who chose Miki's egg:

00:21:38.700 --> 00:21:41.970
Um, you get, um... one Shugoluck Star.

00:21:41.970 --> 00:21:45.610
Feeling annoyed might make you cold to your friends.

00:21:45.610 --> 00:21:46.770
Be careful!

00:21:46.770 --> 00:21:48.900
Your lucky item is playing cards!

00:21:48.900 --> 00:21:51.230
Don't forget to keep smiling!

00:21:51.930 --> 00:21:56.880
Shugo Chara Egg! Amulet Diamond Audition Report!

00:21:59.300 --> 00:22:05.300
Thanks for waiting! Today we'll introduce the people who passed the first round!

00:22:06.590 --> 00:22:12.530
Which of these girls will come through to become our last member?

00:22:12.530 --> 00:22:15.120
What do you think?

00:22:15.120 --> 00:22:18.890
Not only are they all cute, they're unique, too!

00:22:20.600 --> 00:22:25.740
For the second audition, they'll be dancing and singing for us.

00:22:26.160 --> 00:22:30.290
We'll report on the second round next time. Don't miss it!

00:22:32.930 --> 00:22:34.370
They're all so cute!

00:22:34.370 --> 00:22:36.660
Which one will be chosen in the end?

00:22:36.660 --> 00:22:38.800
We'll meet our Diamond soon!

00:22:38.800 --> 00:22:40.780
We hope you're as excited as we are!

00:22:40.780 --> 00:22:43.590
Stay tuned for more Shugo Chara Party next week!

00:22:43.590 --> 00:22:46.880
Lock On: Open Heart!

00:22:46.880 --> 00:22:48.540
Bye-bye!

00:22:51.640 --> 00:22:58.050
C-L-A-P! C-L-A-P! C-L-A-P!

00:23:13.550 --> 00:23:18.710
Let's put our hands together for you! Yes, you!

00:23:18.710 --> 00:23:22.590
Let's put our hands together! That's what I wanna do!

00:23:25.140 --> 00:23:30.290
Now put your hands together for me! Yes, me!

00:23:30.290 --> 00:23:34.100
Now put your hands together! It's what you should do!

00:23:34.700 --> 00:23:40.080
When I first heard your big dream,

00:23:40.080 --> 00:23:45.480
it was like I was whisked away to another place!

00:23:46.340 --> 00:23:52.690
So, I only know a tiny sliver of the world,

00:23:52.690 --> 00:23:56.780
but at least you're here to talk to me.

00:23:56.780 --> 00:24:02.840
Hey! When I saw that look, that serious attitude...

00:24:02.840 --> 00:24:09.100
Before I knew it, my heart was all aflutter!

00:24:09.100 --> 00:24:10.190
Bravo!

00:24:10.840 --> 00:24:14.650
C-L-A-P! C-L-A-P!
